WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Fuel injector
What it does: Meters atomised fuel into the port; does not inject directly into the cylinder.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Fuel injector
How it works: A pulse opens the internal valve.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Fuel injector
How it moves: The body stays fixed; its internal valve opens and closes through electrical pulses.
